{
  "_comment": [
    "LV-6 G1 FIXTURE (docs/SPEC_level_authority_internal.md S4 G1 / S5 item 5) —",
    "the W6+SH ('wsh') posture fixture REGENERATED with the S29.5 EMPIRICAL receiver",
    "GF-bias distribution injected, which is what makes the C4 confound truth-gradable.",
    "",
    "50 solve stations + 1 held-out consumer, 480 epochs = 4 h @ 30 s, DOY 2024-129,",
    "GPS+Galileo synthesized / GPS-only solved, quiet (storm_scale 0), pinned storm",
    "anchor, corrections.signal_bias TRUE (the injected OSB IS the B-record truth).",
    "",
    "WHY 50 and not 300: SPEC_synthetic_minimum_network.md S12.3 measured that 50",
    "stations run the W6+SH slice and scaling to 300 buys nothing (the L2W phase-bias",
    "near-null is n-INVARIANT).  WHY 4 h: the level channel's convergence budget is",
    "~2 h (CLAUDE.md amendment 6), so a 2 h arm is ALL ignition — G1's '>= 2 h' is a",
    "floor on the SETTLED window, graded on the second half.",
    "",
    "rx_code_bias: S29.5's measured field distribution — continental bloc ~ -22 slant",
    "TECU, positive SOUTHERN tail +40..+47, fleet mean ~ -15 TECU (-1.55 m of C1C-C2W",
    "~ -5 ns), sd ~ 21 TECU.  The split is GF-PURE: the ionosphere-free lump",
    "IF_A1*b(C1C) + IF_A2*b(C2W) is identically 0, so the receiver-CLOCK truth channel",
    "is untouched and 100 % of the injection lands in the geometry-free direction.",
    "Regenerate, never hand-edit — see _roster.",
    "",
    "REGENERATE (exactly this, from the repo root):",
    "  python scripts/simnet_make_roster.py config/sim/simnet300_wsh.json \\",
    "         config/sim/simnet50_wsh_f29p5.json --n 50 --consumer --rx-bias-model f29p5",
    "  (then re-apply this _comment; the generator rewrites _roster but not _comment)",
    "  build/x64-Release/gnss_simulator.exe synth-network runs/simnet50_wsh_f29p5 \\",
    "         --sim-config config/sim/simnet50_wsh_f29p5.json",
    "  ~11 s per station, ~10 min for the 51-station roster, 186 MB on disk.",
    "",
    "SIGN FLIP (measured need -- see _lv6g1_wsh50_census.json's header): as generated, the",
    "fleet-median (C1C - C2W) is NEGATIVE and the census level reads +23 vertical TECU HIGH.",
    "The field's own confound is -10..-20 (LOW).  For a sim arm that predicts the field's",
    "DIRECTION, regenerate with:",
    "  python scripts/simnet_make_roster.py config/sim/simnet300_wsh.json \\",
    "         config/sim/simnet50_wsh_f29p5_neg.json --n 50 --consumer --rx-bias-model f29p5 \\",
    "         --rx-bias-bloc-tecu 22 --rx-bias-outlier-tecu -47 -40",
    "and synth-network it into runs/simnet50_wsh_f29p5_neg/.  Do NOT 'fix' this by editing",
    "the station values by hand."
  ],
